LOCATION:LGBTQ+ CULTURE CENTER
GEO:39.168722;-86.525274
SUMMARY:HIV/STI Testing
DESCRIPTION:Free HIV Testing &amp\; Safer Sex Supplies at the LGBTQ+ Cult
 ure Center  Taking care of your sexual health is an important part of you
 r overall well-being\, and we're committed to making resources accessible
 \, welcoming\, and judgment-free.Positive Link (https://iuhealth.org/find
 -medical-services/positive-link-hiv-services) provides free and confident
 ial HIV testing in Room 204 of the LGBTQ+ Culture Center every Thursday f
 rom 10:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m. during the academic year. During the summer\,
  testing is available on the first and third Thursdays of each month.  In
  addition\, during the academic year\, the Monroe County Health Departmen
 t offers free chlamydia and gonorrhea testing on the third Thursday of ev
 ery month\, also from 10:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m. in Room 101.  The LGBTQ+ Cu
 lture Center also offers a variety of free safer sex supplies\, including
  condoms\, internal condoms\, dental dams\, lubricants\, and educational 
 materials on proper use. These resources are available to all students\, 
 free of charge. You can find them in the kitchenette area near the back e
 ntrance of the Center and are welcome to take what you need.  STI Testing
  &amp\; Safer Sex Resources Beyond Campus  Prioritizing your sexual healt
 h should be simple and accessible. In addition to services available at t
 he LGBTQ+ Culture Center\, students can receive testing on campus through
  the IU Student Health Center (https://healthcenter.indiana.edu/medical/s
 ti-testing/index.html) or visit several local organizations (https://heal
 thcenter.indiana.edu/health-answers/sexual-health/sti-testing-resources.h
 tml) that offer free or low-cost testing and prevention services.  Many o
 f these providers offer confidential care\, safer sex supplies\, and supp
 ortive information about prevention\, treatment\, and sexual wellness. If
  you're unsure where to start\, we're happy to help connect you with reso
 urces that fit your needs.All Indiana University events\, groups\, activi
 ties\, educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all me
 mbers of the Indiana University community.
